# A git bundle of this branch cannot live on this branch: every commit after it
# lands makes it incomplete, so a committed copy is wrong by construction. It is
# a packet member, rebuilt by `tools/build_provenance.py` at packet time.
# COMMIT_PROVENANCE.json -- the half a reader can check offline -- IS committed.
provenance/

